      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a good start, but i want to dig a bit deeper into the \"why\" behind those choices. \n\nspecifically, for the Lagos user, why do you lean toward \"vibrant/high-contrast\" and \"simple\" vs something more sophisticated? and for the Tokyo investor, is the \"minimalist/exclusive\" vibe because of a cultural preference for subtlety, or is it more about their economic status? i want to make sure i'm not just applying blanket stereotypes to these groups, but actually understanding the cultural or socioeconomic drivers you're seeing here.",
